    "edited_at": null,
    "content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@stux\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>stux</span></a></span> I'm slightly hijacking this thread:</p><p>If you are new to the <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/fediverse\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>fediverse</span></a> or just unfamiliar, this is an <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/admin\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>admin</span></a> warning fellow admins who to <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/block\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>block</span></a>.  Seems obvious right?  </p><p>You might make the comparison that it's one restaurant warning other fellow restaurants who to refuse service to.  Not quite.  People like me who are on small private instance *STILL* benefit.  I cannot thank <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@stux\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>stux</span></a></span> and many other admins enough for the service they provide to EVERYONE, even if he's not *my* actual admin.</p>",
    "reblog": null,
    "account": {
      "id": "110950541669883227",
      "username": "josh",
      "acct": "josh@hactivedirectory.com",
      "display_name": "Josh (I fight for the users!)",
      "locked": false,
      "bot": false,
      "discoverable": true,
      "indexable": false,
      "group": false,
      "created_at": "2025-01-21T00:00:00.000Z",
      "note": "<p>Pro <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/democracy\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>democracy</span></a>, <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/gay\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>gay</span></a>, <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/tech\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>tech</span></a> enthusiast <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/bro\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>bro</span></a>.  Death to <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/facebook\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>facebook</span></a>!  <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/totk\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>totk</span></a> (and all things <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/zelda\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>zelda</span></a>) and <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/kingdomhearts\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>kingdomhearts</span></a> are my happy place.  I'm inclined to <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/philosophy\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>philosophy</span></a>, <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/thoughtful\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>thoughtful</span></a>, adopt <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/stoicism\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>stoicism</span></a> whenever possible, soft spot for <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/law\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>law</span></a>, interested in <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/uspol\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>uspol</span></a> and <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/politics\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>politics</span></a> abroad. </p><p>I believe in both <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/enterprise\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>enterprise</span></a> tech and <a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/smallweb\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>smallweb</span></a>.</p><p><a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/pittsburgh\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>pittsburgh</span></a> native who lived all over the place and then came home.  <br><a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/tags/fediverse\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>fediverse</span></a> forever!! </p><p>Proud husbro to <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/@mrburns\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mrburns</span></a></span> and doggo-dad to <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://hactivedirectory.com/@harleythedoggo\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>harleythedoggo</span></a></span>.</p>",
